ept</li>\n    <li><strong>Step 6</strong>: Setup at least 1 Product Group & Product/Service (Product/Service) (<a href=\"http://wiki.dhru.com/Product_Configuration\" target=\"_blank\">More Help</a>)</li>\n                 <div style=\"text-align: left;padding-left:80px\"><strong>or</strong></div>\n    <li><strong>Step 6</strong>: If you want setup all IMEI service auto, Just go Settings > APi Settings and active Unlockbase api , after active click on \"Edit and Sync\" save your unlockbase api key , check all options and start sync.</li>\n </ul>\n    <br />\n    <h3>Basic Security Tips:</h3>\n            <br />\n<ul style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">\n              <li>Protract your admin folder by .htaccess password (<a href=\"http://dhru.com/knowledgebase/999146/Security---Password-Protected-Directories.html\" target=\"_blank\">More Help</a>)</li>\n                <div style=\"text-align: left;padding-left:30px\"><strong>or</strong></div>\n               <li>Setup your ip range in Settings > Security > \"Admin Allowed IP\"</li> <br />\n              <li>Enable block account on country mismatch  Settings > Security >  \"Blocked Account \"</li>\n              <li>Do not share your password and if possible always save password with your browser .</li>\n </ul>\n            <br />\n<h5>For more information please refer to our documentation @ <a href=\"http://wiki.dhru.com/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://wiki.dhru.com/</a> for lots of useful information and help videos .</h5>\n<br />\n\n\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"donotshow\" id=\"donotshow\" value=\"1\"/> <label for=\"donotshow\">Do not Show again.</label>\n    <br />&nbsp;\n\n\t<div  id=\"startupclose\" style=\"float: right;position: absolute;top:5px;right:10px;background: #ccc;padding:2px 5px;\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" style=\"text-decoration: none;color:white;font-size:12px\" id=\"bsa_close\" title=\"Hide this!\">X</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n";
